      "goal": "Use these values\n\nField\tValue\nUsername\tdemo.user\nPassword\tDemo1234\nOTP code\t123456\nDemo card\tDemo Credit Card **** 1234\nRequested limit\t7500\nPending trigger\t9999 (forces pending result)\n\n\nScenario Description:\n\n\n## H1 — Happy path: full auth chain + credit-limit-style flow + success\n\n**Goal:** Splash → version check → login → OTP → 3 popups → Dashboard → menu → flow → submit → success → home.\n\n1. Launch app. Wait for `splash_title_text` to be visible.\n2. Wait for Version Check: `version_check_next_time_button` visible.\n3. Tap `version_check_next_time_button` (or `version_check_update_now_button` — both navigate to Login).\n4. On Login: type `demo.user` into `login_username_input`, type `Demo1234` into `login_password_input`, tap `login_submit_button`.\n5. On OTP: type `1` into `otp_digit_1_input`, `2` into `otp_digit_2_input`, …, `6` into `otp_digit_6_input`. Tap `otp_verify_button`.\n6. Legal popup appears (title text `Demo Terms`). Tap `popup_legal_accept_button`.\n7. Reminder popup appears (title text `Reminder`). Tap `popup_reminder_later_button`.\n8. Notifications popup appears (title text `Enable Notifications`). Tap `popup_notifications_not_now_button`.\n9. Verify Dashboard Home: `dashboard_greeting_text` text equals `Hello, Alex`.\n10. Verify `dashboard_recent_list` is visible and contains 3 rows after the ~400 ms loading state.\n11. Tap `dashboard_menu_button` (hamburger).\n12. Verify Menu screen: `menu_action_increase_limit_button` visible.\n13. Tap `menu_action_increase_limit_button`.\n14. Verify Card Selector: `card_selector_recycler` visible with 3 rows.\n15. Tap the row whose `card_selector_card_masked_number_text` equals `**** 1234`.\n16. Verify Limit Value Entry: `limit_entry_selected_card_text` contains `**** 1234`. `limit_entry_current_limit_text` shows `5000 demo`. `limit_entry_available_limit_text` shows `2500 demo`.\n17. Type `7500` into `limit_entry_value_input`. Tap `limit_entry_continue_button`.\n18. Verify Agreement: `agreement_checkbox` visible and unchecked.\n19. Tap `agreement_checkbox`. Tap `agreement_continue_button`.\n20. Verify Review: `review_selected_card_value_text` contains `**** 1234`, `review_requested_limit_value_text` equals `7500`, `review_agreement_status_text` equals `Accepted`.\n21. Tap `review_submit_button`. Verify the confirm dialog: `review_confirm_dialog` visible.\n22. Tap `review_confirm_submit_button`.\n23. Wait for Result: `result_title_text` equals `Demo Limit Request Submitted`. `result_message_text` equals `Your demo request was submitted successfully`. `result_retry_button` is **not** visible. `result_icon_image` content-desc = `Success`.\n24. Tap `result_back_home_button`. Verify Dashboard Home is shown again.",
